{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026edxFuuVPgz1794709900.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>黃大仙下邨有單位起火至少200人疏散，事後單位內發現一具屍體。</p><p></p><p>大火救熄後，消防繼續在涉事單位內射水降溫。</p><p></p><p>警方稱早上8時許接報，黃大仙下邨龍光樓，一個低層單位發生火警，約200至300人要疏散，消防事後在單位內發現一具屍體。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T04:15:19.588147+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T02:29:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T07:10:35.819713+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T04:08:39.534320+00:00","content_hash":"2299222c5474054d6e8af198e8d73143b9f4356b4051b84146df501e74c23b66","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-15T04:15:19.588147+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}